-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
PLACEHOLDER: Replace this file with your server's SSL certificate.

How to get your certificate:
1. If using Let's Encrypt:
   cat /etc/letsencrypt/live/your-domain/fullchain.pem > lanmiao_server.pem

2. If using a self-signed cert:
   openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:2048 -keyout key.pem -out lanmiao_server.pem \
     -days 3650 -nodes -subj "/CN=your-server-ip-or-domain"

3. If using Nginx with SSL:
   cat /etc/nginx/ssl/your-cert.pem > lanmiao_server.pem

The certificate must match the server IP or domain configured in .env.production.
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
